      "statement": "The submitted dipoles and consistently defined ESP observables establish the cross-series ground-state polarization comparison using the supplied chemical identities. The source-supported reference trend increases from 0CN through 1CN to 2CN, but an evidence-backed method-dependent departure is valid when the values, uncertainty, convention and limitation are reported.",
